WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.176
Watch and read: Ama asks: You are reading “We went to the market.” aloud. What helps

00:00:05.176 --> 00:00:06.109
you read smoothly?

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:12.271
The answer is: Read accurately at a steady pace. Reading fluency includes accuracy,

00:00:12.271 --> 00:00:13.499
pacing and expression.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:19.657
Watch and read: Ama asks: When reading “We went to the market.” why should you notice

00:00:19.657 --> 00:00:20.319
the punctuation?

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.648
The answer is: It guides your expression and pauses. Punctuation helps reading sound

00:00:26.648 --> 00:00:27.067
meaningful.
